  "title": "New text and image models, with Gemini routing repaired",
  "summary": "New text and image models arrived; quests got a clearer CLI view, tiers went away, and model-health data learned to say how old it is.\n\nAdded ChatGPT 5.6 Sol, Terra, and Luna with tools, reasoning, up to 10 reference images, and 1,050,000-token context windows. Seedream 5.0 Pro adds image generation and editing with up to 10 reference images. Gemini Flash Lite and fast search now route to Google's GA model after the preview was retired; Flux Schnell's provider listing was also corrected without changing its routing.\n\nRemoved user-tier progression and hourly Pollen refills. Tiers no longer govern model access or wallet behavior, while existing Quest and Paid Pollen balances remain intact and generation still spends Quest Pollen first. Enter's tier controls and tier fields in account responses and SDK types were removed.\n\n`polli quests` now shows account reward status alongside quests, with filters for open, claimable, claimed, and coming-soon quests. It replaces `polli quests mine`; claiming still happens in the dashboard.",
